  $ theta.alt_i in "span"_(bb(C)) { h \( U \( v_i \)_1 \) : h in "Hom"_(upright("Hdg")) \( U \( v_i \) \, H^1 \( Y \, bb(Q) \) \) } \, #h(2em) 1 lt.eq i lt.eq 4 . $
  The maps are rational, so they commute with scalar complex conjugation, which sends $U \( v_i \)_1$ to $U \( v_i \)_c$. Consequently
  $ overline(theta.alt_i) in "span"_(bb(C)) { h \( U \( v_i \)_c \) : h in "Hom"_(upright("Hdg")) \( U \( v_i \) \, H^1 \( Y \, bb(Q) \) \) } \, #h(2em) i = 3 \, 4 . $
